Going forward, that knowledge gap has been closed for me personally. I am committed to applying the improved response sequence described above and to supporting any organizational efforts that make the same clarity available to every colleague.

The experience has strengthened both my individual security posture and my appreciation for the value of a well-designed, well-communicated incident-reporting process.

